{"author": "pgaudet", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete \n\nGO:0006116\tNADH oxidation\nGO:0070995\tNADPH oxidation\n\nThe reason for obsoletion is that these terms represent reactants in oxidation and reduction reactions. \nSee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/29050\n\nAnnotations are here: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1sm-72LgsOnezC8pzq4yAq9twDWQf910WjhwiLf4VK80/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\nThere are 45 manual annotations to these terms: \n\nGroup | Number of annotations | status\n-- | -- | --\nAgBase | 2 | DONE\nBHF-UCL | 4 |  DONE\nCAFA | 3 |  DONE\nEcoCyc | 1 |  \nFlyBase | 4 |   DONE\nMGI | 2 |  \nRGD | 8 |   DONE\nSGD | 12 |  DONE\nTAIR | 1 |  DONE\nUniProt | 8 | DONE\n\nThanks\n\nPascale", "created_at": "2025-02-27T16:07:44Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to NADH oxidation & NADPH oxidation", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2025-04-08T08:21:05Z"}
